  {
    "id": "sitl12-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "sitl12-tab",
    "name": "MAVLink 2 signing template (dry-run notes)",
    "info": "Primary Connection: sign outbound + require signed inbound + passphrase credential.\nCompanion Connection: require signed inbound only (sign-off) — untrusted frames should show trusted=false on mavlink-in.\n\nDry-run procedure:\n1. Set the same signing key on the SITL side (ArduPilot: SERIALn_OPTIONS / signing params; PX4: version-specific).\n2. Deploy this flow; watch mavlink-in msg.trusted on both connections.\n3. Send arm on the signed connection — frame must be signed outbound.\n4. First-contact / one-minute window / monotonic timestamp behaviour per DESIGN.md §7.\n\nLaunch (single ArduCopter sysid 1):\n  sim_vehicle.py -v ArduCopter --out=udp:127.0.0.1:14551\n\nPrimary: bind 127.0.0.1:14550 → remote 127.0.0.1:14551.\nCompanion: bind 127.0.0.1:14560 → remote 127.0.0.1:14551 (listen-only mirror of SITL output).\n\nSigning is off by default in all other examples.",
    "x": 280,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
